\begin_layout Title
Code to compute 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 and detect K-unstability
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $P\subset\mathbb{R}^{n}$
\end_inset

 be a lattice polytope which is defined by 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
P=\left\{ x\in\mathbb{R}^{n}\mid\left\langle x,v_{i}\right\rangle +a_{i}\ge0,\ \forall1\le i\le d\right\} ,
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}^{n}$
\end_inset

 are primitive vectors and 
\begin_inset Formula $a_{i}\in\mathbb{Z}$
\end_inset

.
 Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

 be the lattice measure on the boundary 
\begin_inset Formula $\partial P$
\end_inset

,
 which is defined as follows.
 Consider a facet of 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
F_{i}=\left\{ x\in P\mid\left\langle x,v_{i}\right\rangle +a_{i}=0\right\} .
\]

\end_inset

Define 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathrm{d}\sigma|_{F_{i}}=\frac{\mathrm{d}s}{\left|v_{i}\right|}
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}s$
\end_inset

 is the Euclidean surface measure on 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}$
\end_inset

,
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\left|v_{i}\right|$
\end_inset

 is the Euclidean 
\begin_inset Formula $2$
\end_inset

-norm.
 Another way to define 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathrm{d}\sigma$
\end_inset

:
 it is the Lebesgue measure on the affine space spanned by 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}$
\end_inset

 which is normalized by the rank 
\begin_inset Formula $n-1$
\end_inset

 lattice 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{i}\cap\mathbb{Z}^{n}$
\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The relative DF invariant is 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
M_{\ell}(f)\coloneqq\int_{\partial P}f\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}f\ell_{P}\mathrm{d}x,\ \text{for convex }f:P\rightarrow\mathbb{R},
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 is the unique affine function such that 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
M_{\ell}(h)=\int_{\partial P}h\mathrm{d}\sigma-\int_{P}h\ell_{P}\mathrm{d}x=0,\ \text{for all affine function }h.
\]

\end_inset

Equivalently,
 take 
\begin_inset Formula $h=1,x_{i}$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 satisfies linear system:
 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\int_{P}\ell_{P}=\left|\partial P\right|_{\mathrm{d}\sigma},\int_{P}x_{i}\ell_{P}=\int_{\partial P}x_{i}\mathrm{d}\sigma,\ i=1,\dots,n.
\]

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Definition
We say 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-semistable if 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(f)\geq0$
\end_inset

 for all 
\begin_inset Formula $f\in\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

,
 where 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

 is the space of continuous functions on 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

.
 Otherwise,
 if 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(f)<0$
\end_inset

 for some 
\begin_inset Formula $f\in\mathcal{C}(P)$
\end_inset

,
 we say 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-unstable.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Fact
\begin_inset Argument 1
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Donaldson
\end_layout

\end_inset

 when 
\begin_inset Formula $n=2$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

 is relatively K-unstable if and only if there is a simple convex function of the form 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
g=\max\left\{ ax+by+c,0\right\} 
\]

\end_inset

such that 
\begin_inset Formula $M_{\ell}(g)<0$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Goal:
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
1.
 compute 
\begin_inset Formula $\ell_{P}$
\end_inset

 precisely.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
2.
 develop an algorithm to test the un-stability of polygons using the fact of Donaldson.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
3.
 前面是给定多面体，
探测它是否unstable.
 现在我想搜索2维的relative K-unstable 多面体.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
输入面facet的个数
\begin_inset Formula $d$
\end_inset

,
 正整数
\begin_inset Formula $N$
\end_inset

,
 遍历
\begin_inset Formula $d$
\end_inset

个primitive integer vector 
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i}=\left(a_{i},b_{i}\right)\in\mathbb{Z}^{2}$
\end_inset

 使得
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\gcd\left(a_{i},b_{i}\right)=1\text{ and }\max\left\{ \left|a_{i}\right|,\left|b_{i}\right|\right\} \le N.
\]

\end_inset

然后再选取 
\begin_inset Formula $t_{1},\dots,t_{d}$
\end_inset

 定义多面体
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
P=\left\{ x\in\mathbb{R}^{n}\mid\left\langle x,v_{i}\right\rangle \ge t_{i},\ \forall1\le i\le d\right\} .
\]

\end_inset

要使得
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

没有hidden facet,
 即每个
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i}$
\end_inset

都对应着一个facet,
 否则某些
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i}$
\end_inset

是多余的.
 然后check 
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

是否是relatively K-unstable?
 可用现成的Donaldson简单凸函数判别程序.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
注意上述参数
\begin_inset Formula $v_{i},t_{i}$
\end_inset

有自由度的冗余.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
(1) 对
\begin_inset Formula $\forall a>0$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $(t_{i})$
\end_inset

 和 
\begin_inset Formula $(at_{i})$
\end_inset

 是等价的,
 因为
\begin_inset Formula $(at_{i})$
\end_inset

对应
\begin_inset Formula $aP$
\end_inset

,
 与
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

的稳定性一致.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
(2) 对
\begin_inset Formula $\forall y\in\mathbb{R}^{n}$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $(t_{i}+\left\langle y,v_{i}\right\rangle )$
\end_inset

 和 
\begin_inset Formula $(t_{i})$
\end_inset

 是等价的.
 因为前者对应着
\begin_inset Formula $P+y$
\end_inset

,
 与
\begin_inset Formula $P$
\end_inset

的稳定性一致.
 
\end_layout

